      "side": 1,
      "message": "In my experience, `-lm` cannot be omitted. Nathan, do you know why we don\u0027t need to link with `-lm` for other CPUs?",
      "revId": "14ebd47e3f0fc54375a65c12bc5a76b9633074ce",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
