      "writtenOn": "2026-09-25T15:57:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It is strange to need to link with the Standard C++ Library explicitly. I think this is caused by setting `CMAKE_CXX_COMPILER` to a C compiler (clang). If `CMAKE_CXX_COMPILER` is a C++ compiler, it will take care of linking with the Standard C++ Library when used as the linker.",
      "revId": "14ebd47e3f0fc54375a65c12bc5a76b9633074ce",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
